# Expo Router Screen Examples ({{ ui }})

Data comes from TanStack Query hooks, never copied into state with an effect. No manual
`useCallback` / `useMemo` (the React Compiler memoizes); every user-facing string goes
through `t()`; every screen root has a `testID` for tests and Maestro flows.

