## useFocusEffect for Data Refresh

Refresh data when a screen comes into focus (e.g., after returning from a form).

```typescript
import { useFocusEffect } from 'expo-router';
import { useCallback } from 'react';

export default function BudgetsScreen() {
  const { refetch } = useBudgets();

  // useFocusEffect re-runs when its callback identity changes: keep the useCallback here
  useFocusEffect(
    useCallback(() => {
      refetch();
    }, [refetch])
  );

  // ... rest of screen
}
```
